From: Project Luma <noreply@invalid.example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: anchor running marks and share native Dash tile geometry

Use the existing Dash model and St scroll fade. Keep saved padding and
physical edge policy; animate only artwork. No extension or session helper.

